    {
      "subId": "4003301",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Bantan Sango Detective Agency",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400330101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400330101": {
            "id": "400330101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Oh, you're right on cue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330102"
            ]
          },
          "400330102": {
            "id": "400330102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I just finished scouting out several suspicious spots.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330103"
            ]
          },
          "400330103": {
            "id": "400330103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "One of those encampments is guarded by the \"Top\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330104"
            ]
          },
          "400330104": {
            "id": "400330104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Ahem. I mean, by \"Black Shadow.\" If you've got no other questions...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330105"
            ]
          },
          "400330105": {
            "id": "400330105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "As for yesterday's investigations...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330106"
            ]
          },
          "400330106": {
            "id": "400330106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "As for that, I don't know anything at the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330107"
            ]
          },
          "400330107": {
            "id": "400330107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh!? Didn't Sango get you to go investigate?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330108"
            ]
          },
          "400330108": {
            "id": "400330108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "She did, yes, but... How should I put it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330109"
            ]
          },
          "400330109": {
            "id": "400330109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "For example, \"some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\" don't connect meaningfully in my mind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330110"
            ]
          },
          "400330110": {
            "id": "400330110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "But for Sango, these are the materials she needs to unlock mysteries as complex as \"yosegizaiku.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330111"
            ]
          },
          "400330111": {
            "id": "400330111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\"... How are these related, actually?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330112"
            ]
          },
          "400330112": {
            "id": "400330112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "I'm just using an analogy. At her direction, I investigated some locations in Yashiori Island and Chinju Forest before reporting what I had seen back to her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330113"
            ]
          },
          "400330113": {
            "id": "400330113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "As for any conclusions she might have drawn from my reports, only she knows what they are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330114"
            ]
          },
          "400330114": {
            "id": "400330114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "To be honest, only Shikanoin is able to keep up with her train of thought...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330115"
            ]
          },
          "400330115": {
            "id": "400330115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Shikanoin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330116"
            ]
          },
          "400330116": {
            "id": "400330116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Someone from the Tenryou Commission. We had the privilege of making his acquaintance on a previous case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330117"
            ]
          },
          "400330117": {
            "id": "400330117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "He's a rather... unique character. You'll know what I mean should you ever meet him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330118"
            ]
          },
          "400330118": {
            "id": "400330118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Well then. The animals are in your hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400330119"
            ]
          },
          "400330119": {
            "id": "400330119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's still thinking about those \"overripe Lavender Melons\"..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
